{"title": "Soulbreaker Greatsword", "pageid": 4763, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Soulbreaker_Greatsword", "categories": ["Bugs", "Equipment", "Weapons", "Melee weapons", "Martial weapons", "Greatswords", "Rare items", "Sources of Slashing damage", "Sources of Psychic damage", "Psychic set", "Githyanki set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Faded.png/300px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/b/bc/Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Soulbreaker Greatsword image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Faded.png/300px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Soulbreaker Greatsword</span></a> is a rare +1 <a href=\"/wiki/Greatswords\" title=\"Greatswords\">greatsword</a> that grants its wielder the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soulbreaker\" title=\"Soulbreaker\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Soulbreaker_Icon.webp/20px-Soulbreaker_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Soulbreaker_Icon.webp/30px-Soulbreaker_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Soulbreaker_Icon.webp/40px-Soulbreaker_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soulbreaker\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Soulbreaker_Icon.webp/20px-Soulbreaker_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Soulbreaker_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Soulbreaker\" title=\"Soulbreaker\">Soulbreaker</a> weapon action and a bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\">Initiative</a> rolls; it also deals additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span> damage when wielded by a <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">githyanki</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>The sharp metal whispers to you. Pleading. Cursing... Echoes of slain foes.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Damage</dt>\n<dd><div class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/27px-D6_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/40px-D6_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/54px-D6_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=